---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout tone="180dc" title="180DC" description="Lakshya Tiwari's 180 Degrees Consulting journey.">
  <section class="brand-hero">
    <div class="brand-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow rise">180 Degrees Consulting</span>
      <h1 class="rise rise-2">Consulting for social impact.</h1>
      <p class="rise rise-3">
        My journey with <a href="https://www.180dc.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >180 Degrees Consulting</a
        >, the world’s largest consultancy for nonprofits and social enterprises — from founding a
        branch to the Global Leadership Team.
      </p>
      <div class="brand-stats rise rise-4">
        <div><strong>APAC</strong><span>Best New Branch</span></div>
        <div><strong>8</strong><span>clients onboarded</span></div>
        <div><strong>2024</strong><span>founded at NIT Warangal</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>Founding 180DC NIT Warangal</h2>
  <p class="muted">Founder and Director of Clients & Outreach · Sep 2024</p>
  <p>
    Set up the 180DC branch at NIT Warangal, which was named Best New Branch in APAC. Onboarded
    eight clients, including Labourhome, Ecosaviours, Storelink and Feeding India by Zomato,
    working on impact measurement, market sizing, growth, GTM and pricing.
  </p>

  <h2>Global Leadership Team</h2>
  <p class="muted">Coming soon.</p>

  <h2>Branch Pairing</h2>
  <p class="muted">Coming soon.</p>

  <h2>Passion projects</h2>
  <p class="muted">Coming soon.</p>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Full-bleed band in 180DC's charcoal and green */
  .brand-hero {
    margin: -4.5rem calc(50% - 50vw) 1rem;
    padding: 5rem 1.25rem 3.5rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(36rem 18rem at 100% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--dc-green) 28%, transparent), transparent 70%),
      var(--dc-charcoal);
    color: #f4f5f2;
  }

  .brand-inner {
    max-width: calc(var(--measure) - 2.5rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .brand-hero .eyebrow {
    color: var(--dc-green);
  }

  .brand-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .brand-hero p {
    max-width: 34rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #c9cdc6;
  }

  .brand-hero a {
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration-color: var(--dc-green);
  }

  .brand-hero a:hover {
    color: var(--dc-green);
  }

  .brand-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(8rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.14);
  }

  .brand-stats div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .brand-stats strong {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--dc-green);
  }

  .brand-stats span {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #aab0a8;
  }

  h2::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--dc-green);
  }
</style>
